   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is Maren, the young swordswoman.\n<Subject 2> is Brann, the old headman.\n<Subject 3> is Liesl, the young village mother.\n<Audio 1> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 2> (S1).\n<Audio 2> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 1> (S2).\n<Audio 3> is the voice-timbre reference for <Subject 3> (S3).\n\ndetailed_description:\n2D cel-shaded dark fantasy seinen anime, cold desaturated colours, dusk light, falling snow.\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1> walks slowly along the snowy road toward the closed arched gate. In the gatehouse's upper window a frightened woman pulls the wooden shutter shut. Nobody speaks.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.480, <Subject 2> (S1) bows too low and holds out a small leather pouch toward <Subject 1>, who stands perfectly still. <Subject 2> (S1), with the thin trembling voice of <Audio 1>, says: <d>[English] The price, as agreed... please.</d> <Subject 1> says nothing.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.552, an extreme close-up of <Subject 1>'s eyes; her irises flicker to gold. <Subject 1> (S2), with the low flat voice of <Audio 2>, says quietly: <d>[English] It's you.</d> A held silence after the line.\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.624, the aftermath of one sword cut: a black smoke demon erupts from Brann's coat. Nobody speaks.\n[Shot 5] At 00:15.104, <Subject 3> recoils, pulling her small son behind her skirt. <Subject 3> (S3), with the hushed frightened voice of <Audio 3>, whispers to the boy: <d>[English] Don't meet her eyes.</d>\n[Shot 6] At 00:18.176, <Subject 1> walks away through the open gate; the gate doors slam shut behind her. Nobody speaks.\n\noverall_soundscape: a cold wind, boots in snow, a shutter, coins, a gate slam.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n",
    "S1: Brann\nS2: Maren\nS3: Liesl"
   ],
